    <string name="app_name">My Accounts</string>
    <string name="sobre"><![CDATA[<b>My Accounts</b> is your complete personal financial manager, designed to offer full control over your financial life in a simple and secure way.<br><br>

<h3>Smart Management</h3>
• <b>Income and Expenses:</b> Register your accounts with dates, categories, and types (Fixed, Variable, etc).<br>
• <b>Installments and Repetitions:</b> Create monthly installments or automatic repetitions with one click.<br>
• <b>Auto-Payment:</b> In the Settings menu, configure the app to automatically clear bills on their due date.<br>
• <b>Notifications:</b> Enable notification import to automatically create entries from bank app alerts.<br><br>

<h3>Analysis and Planning</h3>
• <b>Flexible Summaries:</b> Switch between <b>Monthly</b> or <b>Daily</b> summaries.<br>
• <b>Financial Planning:</b> Set spending goals by category and track your progress.<br>
• <b>Accumulated Balance:</b> Choose to add the previous month\'s balance for a real view of your wealth.<br>
• <b>AI Consulting:</b> Get automatic analysis based on the 50/30/20 rule and saving tips.<br><br>

<h3>Import and Mobility</h3>
• <b>PDF Statements:</b> Import transactions directly from bank statements (Itaú, BB, and Inter).<br>
• <b>Excel Spreadsheets:</b> Export the annual summary to Excel or import data from other devices.<br>
• <b>Cloud Synchronization:</b> Connect your Google account to keep your data safe and synced across multiple devices.<br><br>

<h3>Data Protection</h3>
• <b>Security:</b> Enable password access and set up a <b>Secret Question</b> for recovery.<br>
• <b>Local Backup:</b> Choose a secure folder to save copies of your database.<br>
• <b>Automatic Backup:</b> Protect your data by generating a copy every time the app is closed.<br><br>

<b>Version:</b> %1$s<br>
<b>Developed by:</b> Paulo E S Mesquita<br>
<b>Support:</b> Flávia Borges<br>
<b>Contact:</b> mskapps.brazil@gmail.com]]></string>
